[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100100_02_0010","text":"那今天就在这里说再见了吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100100_02_0020","text":"嗯，是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100100_02_0030","text":"……啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100100_02_0035","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100100_02_0040","text":"……那个\n我有东西想送给灯织酱和巡酱……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100100_02_0050","text":"！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100100_02_0060","text":"我也有！我也有！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100100_02_0070","text":"诶……我也有来着……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100100_02_0080","text":"……呼哇"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100100_02_0090","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30100100_02_0100","text":"呵呵"}]
